    },
    "body": "Record the completed four-row source-state interchange and replace its obsolete pending action. The original quarter export erases selected-source influence; the stored candidate states remain distinct, and categorical transport restores source-dependent Generate responses with mixed calibration. Exact source-copy verifies transport, while wrong final tokens and vocabulary-denominator effects prevent a prediction claim.\n\nThe next action is an authenticated paired learning restart through a separately frozen categorical adapter, preserving original bridge masters and quarter export. Context/potential/Generate learning differs only in clipped versus raw-identity vocabulary credit, with fresh matched optimizer moments and native own-prefix outcomes required.\n\nValidation: claim-wording and diff checks passed. Independent review checked the actual report, all four measured score contrasts, scope limits and proposed restart boundary. The final wording uses score units without assuming a logarithmic interpretation.\n\nReferences #820.\n",
